      <li><strong>Rockland guide:</strong> <a href="/guides/rockland-dispensary-guide">Town-level overview of Rockland dispensaries</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Adult-use customers: bring a valid government-issued photo ID showing you are 21 or older. Medical patients: bring your Maine MMMP card and a valid photo ID.</p>
